 ukawa.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~frontier24/DDAP13/\nLocation: Kyoto\, Japan\nTopics:
  Nonlinear Dynamics & Chaos\, Complex Systems & Network Science\nSize: M\
 nSubmission type: Talks/abstracts\; next call unannounced\nConfidence: co
 nfirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-08\nNotes: Latest officially verified
  edition is DDAP13/YKIS 2024\, part of a longer institute workshop. No su
 bsequent edition or reliable contribution cutoff was found. Historical bi
 ennial timing is not projected across a missing 2026 announcement. No ful
 l-paper proceedings promise is asserted\; monthly review must look for th
 e next call. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Nonlinear dynamics an
 d nonequilibrium complex systems\, including chaos\, collective behavior\
 , statistical physics and dynamics of learning. The latest verified meeti
 ng was linked to a broader Yukawa Institute workshop\; its invited-talk f
 ormat should not be mistaken for a verified open full-paper call.\nAdditi
 onal topics: Machine Learning\nScope sources (2024): https://www2.yukawa.
 kyoto-u.ac.jp/~frontier24/DDAP13/\, https://dynamicsdays.info/ap/\nScope 
